<title>UK: Most metals turn down on LME, apart from zinc.</title>
<headline>Most metals turn down on LME, apart from zinc.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Around lows, but still little changed in slack trade. Off early highs above $2,300 with some lending seen against spreads.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Falls away on cash pricing sales, post-option sales.</p>
<p>ZINC - Snaps up once more, spreads whip out again.</p>
<p>LEAD - Drifts towards $600. TIN - Quiet/softer.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Turns lower on trade sales. ALLOY - Neglected.</p>
</text>
